                                    <br/><br/><div class="instruction-big">Keywords</div>
                                    <p>In order to use the simplyFYI Communications Service you must initially select a &ldquo;Keyword&rdquo;. A &ldquo;keyword&rdquo; is a unique word make up of no more than Twelve (12) characters, such as &ldquo;JOESPIZZA&rdquo;. If you stop using the service, or default on your financial obligation to pay for the service under your contracted term, simplyFYI Communications shall have the right to reclaim your unique &ldquo;Keyword&rdquo; and make it available to another user. Additionally, simplyFYI Communications reserves the right to change your &ldquo;Keyword&rdquo; at any time with 30 days notice to you. simplyFYI Communications will do everything reasonable to provide you a similar &ldquo;Keyword&rdquo; and will transfer your users to your new &ldquo;Keyword&rdquo;.</p>
 
